---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Residential Lease Agreement Template | usignpdf"
  seo={{
    page_description: "A free, standard residential lease agreement template ready to be signed electronically.",
    canonical_url: "https://usignpdf.com/templates/lease-agreement/"
  }}
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto py-20 px-4 md:px-8 prose max-w-none">
    <a href="/templates" class="text-accent no-underline hover:underline">&larr; Back to Templates</a>
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">Residential Lease Agreement Template</h1>

    <p>If you are managing <a href="/use-cases/real-estate">real estate</a>, you need a rock-solid lease agreement. This template covers standard clauses for rent, security deposits, and maintenance responsibilities.</p>

    <div class="bg-surface-alt p-6 border border-border rounded my-8 flex justify-between items-center not-prose">
        <span class="font-bold">Standard Residential Lease Agreement (PDF)</span>
        <a href="#" class="px-4 py-2 bg-accent text-surface rounded hover:bg-accent-hover font-semibold">Download PDF</a>
    </div>

    <h2>Signing Leases Electronically</h2>
    <p>Under the <a href="/legality/us-esign-act">US ESIGN Act</a>, electronic signatures on residential leases are completely legally binding. By using usignpdf, you generate a secure <a href="/security/audit-trails">Audit Trail</a> that protects both the landlord and the tenant.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
